Fire-Vision inference weights

The file models/yoloNano.pt is a YOLOv8-OBB nano checkpoint trained with the
Ultralytics library (the checkpoint records yolov8n-obb.yaml and a single
class name, "fire"). Ultralytics is licensed under the GNU Affero General
Public License v3.0. Ultralytics treats models trained with that package as
AGPL-3.0 as well.

models/yoloNano.onnx is an ONNX export of that same checkpoint at a 320 pixel
input. It is a derived artifact of those weights and is distributed with this
source tree so the public demo does not have to download them.

This repository does not import the Ultralytics package at runtime. The web
service runs the ONNX graph with ONNX Runtime, which is MIT licensed. The
weights themselves should still be treated as AGPL-3.0. This public repository
is the corresponding source for the demo.

The other checkpoints (yoloSmall.pt, yoloFire.pt) are the author's additional
training artifacts and are not loaded by the free-tier service.

